"                    it will not obtain insurance (professional liability, workers' compensation, general liability, auto, etc.) for the \n"
"                    auditor or his/her/its employees. Independent auditors agree by a separate referral agreement to obtain his/her own \n"
"                    insurance coverage and furnish a copy of the certificate of insurance to Primus Auditing Ops. Furthermore, in those \n"
"                    instances in which an independent auditor is retained, Primus Auditing Ops will be acting in the sole capacity of \n"
