#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_lpo_ue_scheme
msgid ""
"<b>EIGHTEENTH. - REPRODUCTION OF CERTIFICATION DOCUMENTS. -</b>  In the event that <b>\"The Client\"</b> provides copies of the certification \n"
"                            documents to others, he/she undertakes to reproduce them in their entirety respecting the <b>\"PAOMX\"</b> format and all the \n"
"                            information contained therein."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_lpo_ue_scheme
msgid ""
"<b>EIGHTH.- REGULATORY DOCUMENTS.- \"The client\"</b> The customer agrees to comply with the regulatory documents of the \n"
"                            certification program for which it has enrolled, including, in the case of \"Certification of Organic Products \n"
"                            under the Organic Products Act: PAOMX\" Quality Management System Procedures Organic Products Law and its regulations, \n"
"                            the Agreement by which the Guidelines for the Organic Operation of Agricultural Activities are published, and the \n"
"                            Agreement by which the National Distinctive Mark for organic products is published and the general rules for its use \n"
"                            in the labeling of products certified as organic are established. In the case of \"Certification of Organic products \n"
"                            under the European Union rules on organic farming: Regulation (EU) 2018/848, Regulation (EU) 2021/1698 and the \n"
"                            applicable Implementing Regulations."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_lpo_ue_scheme
msgid ""
"<b>ELEVENTH. - COMPLAINT RECORDS. - \"The Client\"</b> The customer undertakes to keep available for review the records of all customer \n"
"                            complaints, as well as the corrective actions taken, when requested by <b>\"PAOMX\"</b>."
