"                        “Audit Fee/Total Services” box on page 1 of this Agreement. Failure on Customer's behalf to do so is a \n"
"                        material breach of this Agreement by Customer."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_pgfs_scheme_usa
msgid ""
"<b>Termination by Customer.</b> Desktop Review Portion of Audit. If Customer voluntarily terminates this Agreement in \n"
"                        accordance with Section 10.b. above, but after Primus Auditing Ops has begun the Desktop Review portion of the Audit, Customer \n"
"                        acknowledges and agrees that it shall be responsible for, and pay to Primus Auditing Ops, an amount equal to ONE-THIRD (1/3) of \n"
"                        the Audit Fee indicated in the “Audit Fee/Total Services” box on page 1 of the Agreement. Failure on Customer's behalf to do so \n"
"                        is a material breach of this Agreement by Customer."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_fsma_scheme_usa
msgid ""
"<b>Termination for Cause.</b> If either party fails to fulfill any term or condition of this Agreement, \n"
"                        such failure shall constitute a breach of this Agreement by that party. In such a circumstance, \n"
"                        the non-breaching party shall provide, by regular mail, written notice to the breaching party and include a \n"
"                        sufficient description of the relevant conduct in violation of this Agreement. The breaching party shall \n"
"                        have 15 days from the date the notice is mailed to cure the breach and come into compliance with the terms \n"
"                        of this Agreement. If, after 15 days, the breaching party has not cured the breach, the non-breaching party \n"
"                        may immediately terminate this Agreement with no further obligations by providing written notice of \n"
"                        termination."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_primus_standar_scheme_usa
msgid ""
"<b>Termination for Cause.</b> If either party fails to fulfill any term or condition of this Agreement, \n"
"                        such failure shall constitute a breach of this Agreement by that party. The breaching Party shall have 10 calendar \n"
"                        days from the time of receipt of written notice of such breach, to cure such breach. If after 10 days, the \n"
"                        breaching party has not cured the breach, the non-breaching party may termination this agreement with no further \n"
"                        obligations."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_sustainability_scheme_usa
msgid ""
"<b>Termination for Cause.</b> If either party fails to fulfill any term or condition of this Agreement, such failure \n"
"                        shall constitute a breach of this Agreement by that party. The breaching Party shall have 10 calendar days from the \n"
"                        time of receipt of written notice of such breach, to cure such breach. If after 10 days, the breaching party has \n"
"                        not cured the breach, the non-breaching party may termination this agreement with no further obligations."
msgstr ""

#. module: pao_sign_sa
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pao_sign_sa.sa_smeta_scheme_usa
msgid ""
"<b>Termination for Cause.</b> This Service Agreement shall be indefinite, ending at the time of expiration \n"
"                            of Customer's Certification. If either party fails to fulfill any term or condition of this Agreement, \n"
"                            such failure shall be considered a breach of this Agreement. The breaching party shall have 10 calendar days \n"
"                            from the time of receipt of written notice from the other party to cure such breach. If after 10 days, the \n"
"                            breaching party has not cured the breach, the non-breaching party may terminate this Agreement with no \n"
"                            further obligations.  The 10-day notice provision and termination is not applicable to violation of the \n"
"                            Trademark use, as described in Section 11 herein - where the cure time upon notice will be 15 days."
msgstr ""

