"                            scheduling and performance of the Audit. The total audit fee may include, but not limited to audit fee, \n"
"                            admin fees, report entry times, travel time, evidence review, and travel expenses.  Primus Auditing Ops \n"
"                            will not schedule or perform any audit under this Agreement prior to receipt of full payment for audit fees."
